    "created_at": "2016-10-13T12:36:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-13T12:36:40Z",
    "body": "I think it'd be reasonable for HTML to have a definition you could point to, perhaps even a formal element content category. If we can come up with a good name, I'd be happy to add such a thing.\n",
